# KIKO Platform Knowledge Base

## Project Requirements
- **Problem**: AI-supported competence development for nuclear facility decommissioning
- **Target Users**: Learners, Instructors, and Admins in nuclear industry
- **Functional Requirements**: Document processing, Q&A system, role-based access, course management, vector search
- **Non-Functional Requirements**: Security compliance, low latency (<2s), high availability (99.9%)
- Files: @README.md, @.cursor/rules/project_purpose.mdc

## Project Structure
- @backend/app/main.py - FastAPI entry point
- @frontend/main.py - Streamlit entry point
- @backend/app/services/ - AI/ML services
- @frontend/pages/ - Role-specific UI

## Tech Stack
- **Backend**: FastAPI, SQLAlchemy, PostgreSQL + pgvector, JWT auth
    - Relevant files: @backend/requirements.txt, @backend/app/main.py, @backend/init_db.py
- **Frontend**: Streamlit, requests, plotly, pandas
    - Relevant files: @frontend/requirements.txt, @frontend/main.py
- **AI/ML**: sentence-transformers, FAISS, transformers, torch
- **Infrastructure**: Docker, Docker Compose, pytest
- **Security**: bcrypt, python-jose, cryptography


## Implementation Plan (File: @cursor/rules/implementation_plan.mdc)
1. Data Ingestion & Knowledge Curation
2. Knowledge Graph & Digital Twin Creation
3. Learning Content Generation
4. Assessment & Evaluation
5. User Interaction & Tutoring
6. Human Performance & Safety Monitoring
7. Platform Integration & Deployment
8. Continuous Improvement & Feedback


## User Journey
- **Learner**: Login → View courses → Ask questions → Track progress
- **Instructor**: Login → Upload documents → Create courses → Monitor learners
- **Admin**: Login → Manage system → Monitor performance → Configure settings
- **Edge Cases**: Document processing failures, AI model unavailability, role conflicts
- Files: @frontend/pages/, @.cursor/rules/frontend_development.mdc

